msgstr ""
"[EHL-DSP-005] L'importo offerto %(offered)s supera l'importo richiesto "
"%(claimed)s per la controversia %(name)s."

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
